# Cross-architecture multi-MCU validation -- atmega2560 + stm32f103.
# Exercises the EMULATOR multi-bridge fan-out across two different
# backends simultaneously: the runner spawns a simavr bridge for the
# AVR main and a renode launcher for the stm32 satellite, klippy
# connects to both ptys, and clocksync runs against each independently
# (real-time mode -- see fixture comment for why tick_mode is absent
# in mixed-backend mode).
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict other=stm32f103.dict
CONFIG multi_mcu_avr_stm32.cfg
EMULATOR multi_mcu_avr_stm32.fixture.json

G28
M114
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'other'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
